# The TSIG key `every-floe`'s external-dns would authorise its RFC2136 updates
# with, and the same string as `lab.dns.tsigSecret` — which is where Knot gets
# it. `lab-tsig-key-agrees` compares the two.
#
# This fixture renders and never runs, which is exactly why the value has to
# be right here: the previous one was *generated*, so it could not have
# matched Knot under any circumstances, and nothing that never deploys would
# ever have said so.
CATA_SECRET_KNOT__EXTERNALDNS_TSIG__TSIG_SECRET='kp4bgnFAVCmajGIqOW7rj0MNwRNZHBqMvYaLTwzPHgI='
